Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Docker Permission Denied
Problem: Cannot run docker commands without sudo

Solution:

# Add user to docker group and restart session
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER
newgrp docker
Issue 2: PostgreSQL Connection Failed
Problem: AWX cannot connect to PostgreSQL

Solution:

# Check PostgreSQL status
sudo systemctl status postgresql

# Verify database exists
sudo -u postgres psql -l

# Check pg_hba.conf configuration
sudo cat /var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf
Issue 3: AWX Containers Not Starting
Problem: Docker containers fail to start

Solution:

# Check container logs
docker-compose logs awx_web
docker-compose logs awx_task

# Restart services
docker-compose down
docker-compose up -d
Issue 4: Nginx Configuration Error
Problem: Nginx fails to start or proxy requests

Solution:

# Test Nginx configuration
sudo nginx -t

# Check Nginx error logs
sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log

# Verify upstream server is running
curl http://localhost:8080
